{
  "id": "ZEC.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "ZEC",
  "reference": "Zacarías 6",
  "copyright": "Reina-Valera 1909 - Dominio público. Fue realizada por Sociedades Bíblicas Unidas y publicada por primera vez en 1909.",
  "verseCount": 15,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ZEC 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y TORNÉME, y alcé mis ojos y miré, y he aquí cuatro carros que salían de entre dos montes; y aquellos montes eran de metal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En el primer carro había",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "caballos bermejos, y el segundo carro caballos negros,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y en el tercer carro caballos blancos, y en el cuarto carro caballos overos ruciorodados.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Respondí entonces, y dije al ángel que conmigo hablaba: Señor mío, ¿qué es esto?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y el ángel me respondió, y díjome:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Estos son los cuatro vientos de los cielos, que salen de donde están delante del Señor de toda la tierra.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En el que estaban los caballos negros, salieron hacia la tierra",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "del aquilón; y los blancos salieron tras ellos; y lo overos salieron hacia la tierra del mediodía.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y los rucios salieron, y se afanaron por",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ir á recorrer la tierra. Y dijo: Id, recorred la tierra. Y recorrieron la tierra.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luego me llamó, y hablóme deciendo: Mira, los que salieron hacia la tierra del aquilón hicieron reposar mi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "espíritu en la tierra del aquilón.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y fué á mí palabra de Jehová, diciendo:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toma de los del cautiverio, de Heldai, y de Tobías, y de Jedaía, los cuales volvieron de Babilonia; y vendrás tú en aquel día, y entrarás en casa de Josías hijo de Sefanías;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tomarás pues plata y oro, y harás",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "coronas, y las pondrás en la cabeza del gran sacerdote",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Josué, hijo de Josadac;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y le hablarás, diciendo: Así ha hablado Jehová de los ejércitos, diciendo: He aquí el varón cuyo nombre es",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Pimpollo, el cual germinará",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "de su lugar, y edificará el templo de Jehová:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "El edificará el templo de Jehová, y él",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "llevará gloria, y se sentará y dominará en su trono, y",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "será sacerdote en su solio; y consejo de paz será entre ambos á dos.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y Helem, y Tobías, y Jedaía, y Hen, hijo de Sefanías, tendrán coronas por memorial en el templo de Jehová.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "los que están lejos",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "vendrán y edificarán en el templo de Jehová, y conoceréis que Jehová de los ejércitos me ha enviado á vosotros. Y será",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "esto,",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.6.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "si oyereis obedientes la voz de Jehová vuestro Dios.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
